        {"class": "DepictionHeaderView", "title": "主要功能", "useBoldText": true},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 修复 iOS 17.3.1 SpringBoard 启动快照兼容问题。\n\n- 当第三方 Storyboard 应用被记录为无效启动图时，清理当前拒绝状态并自动重试。\n\n- 每个应用版本或每次安装最多自动重试一次，避免持续重置。\n\n- 所需系统接口不存在或运行时结构不匹配时会停止处理，不强行修改状态。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false},
        {"class": "DepictionSeparatorView"},
        {"class": "DepictionHeaderView", "title": "兼容性", "useBoldText": true},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 仅适用于 iOS `17.3.1`。\n\n- 适用于 RootHide，软件包架构为 `iphoneos-arm64e`。\n\n- 插件加载于 SpringBoard；其他 iOS 版本会保持停用。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false},
        {"class": "DepictionSeparatorView"},
        {"class": "DepictionHeaderView", "title": "使用说明", "useBoldText": true},
        {"class": "DepictionMarkdownView", "markdown": "- 安装后请注销或重启用户空间。\n\n- 本插件针对 Relaxin 白巨魔环境下第三方 Storyboard 应用的启动黑屏。\n\n- 若自动重试后仍然黑屏，插件不会对同一应用版本进行无限重复重置。", "useSpacing": true, "useRawFormat": false},
        {"class": "DepictionTableTextView", "title": "当前版本", "text": "0.1.3"},
